{"session_id":"1074c10b-1f30-4e56-9b35-b46536d50371","transcript_path":"/home/youran/.claude/projects/-mnt-d-research-YouranSun-github-io/1074c10b-1f30-4e56-9b35-b46536d50371.jsonl","cwd":"/mnt/d/research/YouranSun.github.io","permission_mode":"auto","effort":{"level":"high"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"/mnt/d/research/YouranSun.github.io/_pages/about.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/mnt/d/research/YouranSun.github.io/_pages/about.md","content":"---\npermalink: /\ntitle: \"Youran Sun 孙悠然\"\nauthor_profile: true\nredirect_from: \n  - /about/\n  - /about.html\n---\n\nHi, I am Youran, a 3rd-year undergraduate at The Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen, double majoring in Computer Science and Engineering and Interdisciplinary Data Analytics.\n\nMy research interests mainly lie in **LLM-powered data agent and data systems** and **Graph data management**.\n\n> I am now actively seeking a PhD position in Fall 2027!\n\nExperience\n======\n\n* I visited **UC Berkeley** in 2025 spring, where I had the privilege of being supervised by **[Prof. Aditya Parameswaran](https://people.eecs.berkeley.edu/~adityagp/)** and gained a enjoyable and rewarding collaboration with [Dr. Sepanta Zeighami](https://szeighami.github.io/) in the [EPIC Data lab](https://epic.berkeley.edu/).\n* At **CUHK-Shenzhen**, I was supervised by **[Prof. Yixiang Fang](https://fangyixiang.github.io/)** and had the pleasure working closely with [Dr. Yingli Zhou](https://jaylzhou.github.io/), where I was first introduced to academic research.\n\nInterests\n======\nMy research spans the following topics:\n* **LLM-powered data processing:** Improve the data understanding in sematic data processing.\n* **Data-driven LLM systems:** Graph RAG prototype system, knob-tuning method for RAG.\n* **Graph data management:**  Community search, densest subgraph discovery.\n\n<details>\n<summary> <em>Fun fact</em>🧳🗺🎒 </summary>\n<em>I'm lucky to be in the first cohort of CUHK's <a href=\"https://www.idadm.cdmp.cuhk.edu.hk/\">IDADM</a> double-major and cross-campus programme. Thanks to it, my undergraduate study spans 4 terms in Hong Kong, 3 terms in Shenzhen, and 1 term in Berkeley (as a visiting student)!</em>\n</details>\n","numLines":33,"startLine":1,"totalLines":33}},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GW9zJKuqSgjML2GY29NPMZ","duration_ms":37,"logged_at":"2026-05-11T04:10:35"}
