ucture, theme, and key files\"\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: b606e9ca-b863-4906-850e-562afca2707c\n---\n\nJekyll-based academic portfolio site using the academicpages theme, deployed at YouranSun.github.io.\n\n**Key content files:**\n- `_pages/about.md` — homepage (permalink: `/`), main bio and experience\n- `_pages/competitive-programming.md` — detailed CP awards and outreach work\n- `_pages/misc.md` — personal interests (mountains quote, Chinese rock/indie music)\n- `_publications/*.md` — one file per paper with frontmatter (title, venue, date, pdf, code, authors)\n- `_config.yml` — site config: author info, bio, avatar, social links\n- `_data/navigation.yml` — top nav: Publications, Competitive Programming, Misc (Talks/Teaching/CV hidden)\n\n**Theme customizations:**\n- Custom SCSS in `_sass/layout/` (archive, base, footer, page, sidebar)\n- Custom includes: author-profile.html, footer.html, archive-single.html\n- Cat-themed favicon/icons (`images/cat*.png`, `images/cat.ico`)\n- Hover avatar feature (`avatar_hover` in config)\n\n**Why:** Personal academic homepage for PhD applications and research visibility.\n**How to apply:** When editing content, prefer frontmatter fields over inline HTML. The nav is intentionally minimal (3 items).\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RS3WwsBvTHPY5rF9HeBKL8","duration_ms":36,"logged_at":"2026-06-17T23:12:15"}
