d","content":"---\ntitle: \"\"\npermalink: /misc/\nauthor_profile: true\n---\n\n<h1><span lang=\"en\">🏔️ The virtuous love the mountains.</span><span lang=\"zh\">🏔️ 仁者乐山。</span></h1>\n\n<ul>\n  <li lang=\"en\"><em>The wise love the water; the virtuous love the mountains. (The Analects, Yongye)</em></li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\"><em>智者乐水，仁者乐山。——《论语 · 雍也》</em></li>\n</ul>\n\n<!-- I firmly believe people should behave and act morally. If one cannot fully follow it, at least he should not forget it. -->\n\n<!-- The Mountain stands for silence, strength and steadfastness. It stands there, unshaken by any force. It has a magnanimous heart and supports the rest through its presence, as another saying goes -- *The Earth's condition is receptive devotion. The superior man, in accordance with this, carries the outer world with his virtue.（\"地势坤，君子以厚德载物。\"）* -->\n\n<h2><span lang=\"en\">🎧 Music</span><span lang=\"zh\">🎧 音乐</span></h2>\n\n<p lang=\"en\">I have been a fan of Chinese Rock/Indie (<a href=\"https://music.apple.com/album/%E4%B8%87%E8%83%BD%E9%9D%92%E5%B9%B4%E6%97%85%E5%BA%97/1538548871\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/album/%E5%86%80%E8%A5%BF%E5%8D%97%E6%9E%97%E8%B7%AF%E8%A1%8C/1545534900\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/album/%E8%8F%8A%E8%8A%B1%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BB%8D/681818004\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/album/%E6%96%B0%E9%95%BF%E5%BE%81%E8%B7%AF%E4%B8%8A%E7%9A%84%E6%91%87%E6%BB%9A/1585625540\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/album/before-the-applause-rebuilding-the-rights-of-statues/1700446170\">5</a>, <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/us/album/%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%8F%AC%E5%96%9A/1611249232\">6</a>, <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/album/%E9%A2%B1%E9%A2%A8%E4%BE%86%E4%BA%86-live/1474226597\">7</a>, <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/album/%E9%A3%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%99%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%B7%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%B1%E6%9C%9F/1443637757\">8</a>, <a href=\"https://music.apple.com/album/%E9%A3%9B%E5%87%BA%E8%BF%B7%E6%A8%93-2024-mi