{"session_id":"b606e9ca-b863-4906-850e-562afca2707c","transcript_path":"/home/youran/.claude/projects/-mnt-d-research-YouranSun-github-io/b606e9ca-b863-4906-850e-562afca2707c.jsonl","cwd":"/mnt/d/research/YouranSun.github.io","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","effort":{"level":"high"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"/mnt/d/research/YouranSun.github.io/_pages/competitive-programming.md","old_string":"）——","new_string":"） – ","replace_all":true},"tool_response":{"filePath":"/mnt/d/research/YouranSun.github.io/_pages/competitive-programming.md","oldString":"）——","newString":"） – ","originalFile":"---\ntitle: \"Competitive Programming\"\npermalink: /competitive-programming/\nauthor_profile: true\n---\n\n<p lang=\"en\">I have been participating competitive programming since junior high school, attending the <strong>Olympiad in Informatics (OI)</strong> in high school as well as the <strong>International/China Collegiate Programming Contest (ICPC/CCPC)</strong> in college.</p>\n<p lang=\"zh\">我从初中起接触算法竞赛，中学时参加<strong>信息学奥林匹克竞赛（OI）</strong>，大学时参加<strong>国际/中国大学生程序设计竞赛（ICPC/CCPC）</strong>。</p>\n\n<p lang=\"en\">At CUHK-Shenzhen, I served as the <strong>student leader</strong> of the university's 30-member competitive programming team from Jun 2024 to Dec 2025, coached by <a href=\"https://fangyixiang.github.io/\">Prof. Yixiang Fang</a> and <a href=\"https://chenhao-ma.github.io/\">Prof. Chenhao Ma</a>, with additional advice from <a href=\"http://chenjb1997.github.io/\">Prof. Jingbang Chen</a>. During this time, besides contest participation, we continuously provided related resources to the broader university community.</p>\n<p lang=\"zh\">在香港中文大学（深圳），我在 2024 年 6 月至 2025 年 12 月担任 30 人的校程序设计竞赛队<strong>学生队长</strong>，教练为<a href=\"https://fangyixiang.github.io/\">方一向教授</a>和<a href=\"https://chenhao-ma.github.io/\">马晨昊教授</a>，同时受<a href=\"http://chenjb1997.github.io/\">陈靖邦教授</a>的顾问指导。在这段时间里，除组织队伍参加比赛外，我们还持续为整个大学提供算法竞赛的相关资源。</p>\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px;\">\n  <figure style=\"width: 29.45%; text-align: center;\">\n    <img src=\"{{ '/images/CCPC-girls.jpg' | relative_url }}\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n    <figcaption>\n      <span lang=\"en\">Winning CCPC Girls' Division, placing 1st nationwide, together with Xiaoxiao and Jiuzhi.</span>\n      <span lang=\"zh\">与涂宵箫、杨久知共同获得 CCPC 女生专场全国冠军。</span>\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n\n  <figure style=\"width: 33.55%; text-align: center;\">\n    <img src=\"{{ '/images/GBAIPC.jpg' | relative_url }}\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n    <figcaption>\n      <span lang=\"en\">Contributed to the organization of the 2025 Canton-Hong Kong-Macau Greater Bay Area Programming Contest, a part of <a href=\"https://www.slai.edu.cn/\">SLAI</a>'s first cohort admission.</span>\n      <span lang=\"zh\">参与组织 2025 年粤港澳大湾区程序设计竞赛；该赛事是<a href=\"https://www.slai.edu.cn/\">深圳河套人工智能学院</a> 首届招生录取程序的一部分。</span>\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>\n\n<h1><span lang=\"en\">Selected Awards</span><span lang=\"zh\">竞赛奖项</span></h1>\n\n<p lang=\"en\"><strong>College</strong></p>\n<p lang=\"zh\"><strong>大学时期</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🥇<strong>Champion</strong> (1st place) – <a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2025ladies\">The 11<sup>th</sup> CCPC Girls' Division</a>, Oct 2025</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🥇<strong>冠军</strong>（第 1 名）——<a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2025ladies\">第十一届 CCPC 女生专场</a>，2025 年 10 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (26th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/ecfinal?group=official\">The 49<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia East Continent Final Contest</a>, Dec 2024</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 26 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/ecfinal?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 东亚区决赛</a>，2024 年 12 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (6th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/hongkong?group=official\">The 49<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia Hong Kong Regional Contest</a>, Dec 2024</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 6 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/hongkong?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛香港站</a>，2024 年 12 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🥉<strong>2nd Runner-up</strong> (3rd place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/zhengzhou?group=official\">The 10<sup>th</sup> CCPC Zhengzhou site</a>, Nov 2024</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🥉<strong>季军</strong>（第 3 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/zhengzhou?group=official\">第十届 CCPC 国赛（郑州）</a>，2024 年 11 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🥈<strong>1st Runner-up</strong> (2nd place) – <a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2024ladies\">The 10<sup>th</sup> CCPC Girls' Division</a>, Nov 2024</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🥈<strong>亚军</strong>（第 2 名）——<a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2024ladies\">第十届 CCPC 女生专场</a>，2024 年 11 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (16th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/chengdu?group=official\">The 49<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia Chengdu Regional Contest</a>, Oct 2024</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 16 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/chengdu?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛成都站</a>，2024 年 10 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (19th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/harbin?group=official\">The 10<sup>th</sup> CCPC Harbin Site</a>, Oct 2024</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 19 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/harbin?group=official\">第十届 CCPC 国赛（哈尔滨）</a>，2024 年 10 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (17th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/48th/nanjing?group=official\">The 48<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia Nanjing Regional Contest</a>, Nov 2023</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金牌</strong>（第 17 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/48th/nanjing?group=official\">第 48 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛南京站</a>，2023 年 11 月</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p lang=\"en\"><strong>High school</strong></p>\n<p lang=\"zh\"><strong>高中</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🥉<strong>Bronze Medalist</strong> – <a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2024/06/03/75fa469e47f6785fcb88c3dc01a7ec81.htm\">National Olympiad in Informatics</a>, Aug 2022</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🥉<strong>铜牌</strong>——<a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2024/06/03/75fa469e47f6785fcb88c3dc01a7ec81.htm\">全国信息学奥林匹克竞赛（NOI）</a>，2022 年 8 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>1st Prize</strong> (1st place) – <a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2022/05/07/202205070930.htm\">National Olympiad in Informatics, Girls' Contest</a>, May 2022</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>一等奖</strong>（第 1 名）——<a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2022/05/07/202205070930.htm\">全国信息学奥林匹克女生赛</a>，2022 年 5 月</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\">🥈<strong>Silver Medalist</strong> – <a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2021/08/23/165993.html\">National Olympiad in Informatics Summer Camp</a>, Jul 2021</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\">🥈<strong>银牌</strong>——<a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2021/08/23/165993.html\">全国信息学奥林匹克竞赛夏令营（D 类选手）</a>，2021 年 7 月</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h1><span lang=\"en\">Breaking Barriers</span><span lang=\"zh\">打通边界</span></h1>\n\n<p lang=\"en\">The team and I have been making consistent efforts to make competitive welcoming to everyone. The purpose of doing this, is to spread helpful knowledge (Yes, we believe many insights from competitive programming are very beneficial for undergraduate CS study) and provide a home for folks' interest in this field. We managed to overcome many difficulties, including:</p>\n<p lang=\"zh\">整个队伍和我个人一直致力于让算法竞赛更加开放。我们的目的是传播有用的知识（是的，我们相信算法竞赛的许多理解对本科 CS 学习有很大帮助），并为对这一领域感兴趣的同学提供一个集体。我们克服了许多困难，包括：</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li lang=\"en\"><strong>Gender exclusion:</strong> Women participate little in competitive programming contests, and I have worked to increase their participation at our university. Since 2023, 6 girls have joined our team, and 4 of them have become gold medalists in ICPC Asia Regional Contests. I also led teams to participate in the CCPC Girls' Division for three consecutive years (2023 – 2025), helping establish it as a tradition at our university. In Fall 2025, we won <strong>1st place</strong> in <a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2025ladies\">The 11<sup>th</sup> CCPC Girls' Division</a>, obtaining the first champion in this contest in our university's history (see <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FMxGKg2e8ZSot-qS9uJEfg\">WeChat post</a>).</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\"><strong>性别壁垒：</strong>参加算法竞赛的女生很少。为此，我积极在我们学校推动女生参赛。自 2023 年起，共有 6 名女生加入我们队伍，其中 4 人在 ICPC 亚洲区域赛中获得金奖。我连续三年（2023—2025）带队参加 CCPC 女生专场，将其建立为学校和队伍的传统。在 2025 年秋天，我们获得了<a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2025ladies\">第十一届 CCPC 女生专场</a>的<strong>全国第一</strong>，这也是我校历史上首次获得该比赛的冠军（详见<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FMxGKg2e8ZSot-qS9uJEfg\">微信推文</a>）。</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\"><strong>Knowledge barriers:</strong> High-level awards in collegiate contests mostly go to students with prior high school OI experience (like me). To broaden access to beginners, I helped build a selection-and-training mechanism in our school. In 2024 fall, I formed a team where all members had <strong>zero CNOI experience</strong> and offered them <strong>hands-on guidance from scratch</strong>. They finally won a <strong>Gold Medal</strong> (31st place) in <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/chengdu?group=official\">The 49<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia Chengdu Regional Contest</a>.</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\"><strong>知识边界：</strong>大学算法竞赛中的高端奖项大多颁给了具备高中 OI 经验的选手（比如我自己）。为降低入门门槛，我参与建立了学校的选拔与培训机制。2024 年秋季，我组建了一支三个队员<strong>均没有任何 CNOI 参赛经历</strong>的队伍，并为他们提供<strong>从零开始的手把手指导</strong>。最终，他们在<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/chengdu?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛成都站</a>获得了<strong>金奖</strong>（第 31 名）。</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\"><strong>Imbalanced training quality:</strong> Training quality for OI in high schools depends heavily their tiers and resources. Our team provided <strong>weekend lectures</strong> for CUHK-Shenzhen affiliated middle/high schools for OI training (I did a part of them). In 2025, their students achieved 13 prizes in CCF-CSP, with <strong>1 first prize in CSP-S for the first time</strong>, marking a significant breakthrough (see <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/28O-Q5V5HUT9cAIeHFAHdg\">WeChat post</a>).</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\"><strong>资源不均：</strong>高中 OI 的培训质量高度依赖学校的层次与资源。我们队伍每个周末在香港中文大学（深圳）附属学校进行<strong> OI 辅导</strong>（其中一部分是我完成的）。2025 年，这些学生在 CCF-CSP 中共有 13 人次获奖，且<strong>首次斩获了 CSP-S 一等奖</strong>，实现了从零到一的重大突破（详见<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/28O-Q5V5HUT9cAIeHFAHdg\">微信推文</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p lang=\"en\">The team has also been doing other services, including:</p>\n<p lang=\"zh\">队伍还做了以下其他服务：</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li lang=\"en\"><strong>Voluntary final review lectures</strong> for the following courses on programming, algorithms, discrete math, data structures, and database systems: CSC1001, CSC1003, CSC3001, CSC3100, and CSC3170. I did the overall organization for these events in 2024 and 2025. (WeChat posts for <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZPVC79dJH5Pw2-A8m0DJ6A\">2025</a>, <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/17ouE0bikE4DW-8abUU3fw\">2024</a>)</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\"><strong>无偿的期末复习讲座</strong>，面向程序设计、算法、离散数学、数据结构与数据库系统等专业课（CSC1001、CSC1003、CSC3001、CSC3100、CSC3170）。我在 2024 年和 2025 年总负责了这些活动的统筹组织。（微信推文：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZPVC79dJH5Pw2-A8m0DJ6A\">2025 年</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/17ouE0bikE4DW-8abUU3fw\">2024 年</a>）</li>\n  <li lang=\"en\"><strong>CUHK-Shenzhen's annual competitive programming contests.</strong> We welcome college and high school students nationwide to attend our contests and set two division for experienced and unexperienced participants. 300~500 students join our contest every year. I deeply participated the contest organization and execution in 2024, and served as the leading student organizer in 2025. Supported by these successful experiences, we held the ICPC China Shenzhen Invitational in 2026. (WeChat posts for <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TYJgMVE0ewP-qykDglk6Ig\">2025</a>, <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HO15ApkFF3ACXIo66RgKEw\">2024</a>)</li>\n  <li lang=\"zh\"><strong>香港中文大学（深圳）年度算法竞赛。</strong>我们欢迎全国高校及高中生参赛，并设有零基础和有基础两个赛道。每年都有 300～500 名学生参赛。我在 2024 年深度参与了赛事的组织与执行，并在 2025 年担任学生负责人。基于这些成功经验，我们于 2026 年承办了 ICPC 中国深圳邀请赛。（微信推文：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TYJgMVE0ewP-qykDglk6Ig\">2025 年</a>、<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HO15ApkFF3ACXIo66RgKEw\">2024 年</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":35,"oldLines":21,"newStart":35,"newLines":21,"lines":[" "," <ul>","   <li lang=\"en\">🥇<strong>Champion</strong> (1st place) – <a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2025ladies\">The 11<sup>th</sup> CCPC Girls' Division</a>, Oct 2025</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🥇<strong>冠军</strong>（第 1 名）——<a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2025ladies\">第十一届 CCPC 女生专场</a>，2025 年 10 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🥇<strong>冠军</strong>（第 1 名） – <a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2025ladies\">第十一届 CCPC 女生专场</a>，2025 年 10 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (26th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/ecfinal?group=official\">The 49<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia East Continent Final Contest</a>, Dec 2024</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 26 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/ecfinal?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 东亚区决赛</a>，2024 年 12 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 26 名） – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/ecfinal?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 东亚区决赛</a>，2024 年 12 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (6th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/hongkong?group=official\">The 49<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia Hong Kong Regional Contest</a>, Dec 2024</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 6 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/hongkong?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛香港站</a>，2024 年 12 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 6 名） – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/hongkong?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛香港站</a>，2024 年 12 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🥉<strong>2nd Runner-up</strong> (3rd place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/zhengzhou?group=official\">The 10<sup>th</sup> CCPC Zhengzhou site</a>, Nov 2024</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🥉<strong>季军</strong>（第 3 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/zhengzhou?group=official\">第十届 CCPC 国赛（郑州）</a>，2024 年 11 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🥉<strong>季军</strong>（第 3 名） – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/zhengzhou?group=official\">第十届 CCPC 国赛（郑州）</a>，2024 年 11 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🥈<strong>1st Runner-up</strong> (2nd place) – <a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2024ladies\">The 10<sup>th</sup> CCPC Girls' Division</a>, Nov 2024</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🥈<strong>亚军</strong>（第 2 名）——<a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2024ladies\">第十届 CCPC 女生专场</a>，2024 年 11 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🥈<strong>亚军</strong>（第 2 名） – <a href=\"https://rl.algoux.org/ranklist/ccpc2024ladies\">第十届 CCPC 女生专场</a>，2024 年 11 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (16th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/chengdu?group=official\">The 49<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia Chengdu Regional Contest</a>, Oct 2024</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 16 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/chengdu?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛成都站</a>，2024 年 10 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 16 名） – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/49th/chengdu?group=official\">第 49 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛成都站</a>，2024 年 10 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (19th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/harbin?group=official\">The 10<sup>th</sup> CCPC Harbin Site</a>, Oct 2024</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 19 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/harbin?group=official\">第十届 CCPC 国赛（哈尔滨）</a>，2024 年 10 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金奖</strong>（第 19 名） – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/ccpc/10th/harbin?group=official\">第十届 CCPC 国赛（哈尔滨）</a>，2024 年 10 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>Gold Medalist</strong> (17th place) – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/48th/nanjing?group=official\">The 48<sup>th</sup> ICPC Asia Nanjing Regional Contest</a>, Nov 2023</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金牌</strong>（第 17 名）——<a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/48th/nanjing?group=official\">第 48 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛南京站</a>，2023 年 11 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>金牌</strong>（第 17 名） – <a href=\"https://board.xcpcio.com/icpc/48th/nanjing?group=official\">第 48 届 ICPC 亚洲区域赛南京站</a>，2023 年 11 月</li>"," </ul>"," "," <p lang=\"en\"><strong>High school</strong></p>"]},{"oldStart":59,"oldLines":7,"newStart":59,"newLines":7,"lines":["   <li lang=\"en\">🥉<strong>Bronze Medalist</strong> – <a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2024/06/03/75fa469e47f6785fcb88c3dc01a7ec81.htm\">National Olympiad in Informatics</a>, Aug 2022</li>","   <li lang=\"zh\">🥉<strong>铜牌</strong>——<a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2024/06/03/75fa469e47f6785fcb88c3dc01a7ec81.htm\">全国信息学奥林匹克竞赛（NOI）</a>，2022 年 8 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🏆<strong>1st Prize</strong> (1st place) – <a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2022/05/07/202205070930.htm\">National Olympiad in Informatics, Girls' Contest</a>, May 2022</li>","-  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>一等奖</strong>（第 1 名）——<a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2022/05/07/202205070930.htm\">全国信息学奥林匹克女生赛</a>，2022 年 5 月</li>","+  <li lang=\"zh\">🏆<strong>一等奖</strong>（第 1 名） – <a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2022/05/07/202205070930.htm\">全国信息学奥林匹克女生赛</a>，2022 年 5 月</li>","   <li lang=\"en\">🥈<strong>Silver Medalist</strong> – <a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2021/08/23/165993.html\">National Olympiad in Informatics Summer Camp</a>, Jul 2021</li>","   <li lang=\"zh\">🥈<strong>银牌</strong>——<a href=\"https://www.noi.cn/upload/resources/file/2021/08/23/165993.html\">全国信息学奥林匹克竞赛夏令营（D 类选手）</a>，2021 年 7 月</li>"," </ul>"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":true},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T5nzmcCFTesGrsJZ3ERNTp","duration_ms":94,"logged_at":"2026-06-18T13:47:47"}
